sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Player or guest (App)
  participant C as lib/query cache
  participant R as PostgREST/RLS (anon or authenticated)
  participant F as search_feed() SECURITY INVOKER
  participant P as Postgres (pg_trgm GIN indexes)
  U->>U: type "riverbend" (debounce 250 ms, min 2 chars)
  U->>C: useSearch(q, scope) key search:q:scope:region
  C->>R: rpc search_feed(q, scope, region)
  R->>F: runs as the caller, so every table's RLS applies
  F->>P: events (title, location, description) where not cancelled, next 60 days or my past games
  F->>P: external_sessions (title, venue) in region, fresh rows only
  F->>P: profiles (username, first/last name) that host or co-host upcoming games
  F->>P: clubs (name, location_name)
  P-->>F: ranked by similarity then date, limit 20 per kind
  F-->>C: jsonb {events, external, hosts, clubs}
  C-->>U: grouped results, tap opens routes.event / external link / routes.profileOf / routes.club
  U->>U: Enter or tap saves q in recent searches (device storage, max 8)
